TYFZA1 LuCI feed patches
========================

These patches modify the LuCI feed (not this package). Apply them after
"scripts/feeds update luci" and before building:

  for p in package/luci-app-tyfza1-pon/feed-patches/*.patch; do
      git -C feeds/luci apply "$p"
  done

- 100-tyfza1-system-status: surface the luci.tyfza1-system hardware RPC
  (served by this package) on the system status page.
- 101-tyfza1-resource-version: cache-bust LuCI static resources.
- 110-tyfza1-txpower-label: label the current txpower limit on the
  wireless page.
